

<!-- toggleCollapse / openModal / closeModal / openEditModal are declared
     once, globally, in views/school-admin/dashboard.ejs — not here. They
     used to live in this file's own <script>, which only ever executes
     on the very first page load (when Overview happens to be the
     default section rendered server-side); once the admin navigates to
     another tab and back via loadSection's innerHTML swap, a <script>
     tag re-inserted that way never runs, so a second definition here
     would just never fire anyway. See dashboard.ejs for the real ones. -->


